{"availability":"available","full":"stixx/openapi-command-bundle","name":"openapi-command-bundle","description":"Create Command-Bus APIs with auto-generated OpenAPI docs and schema-driven request validation","category":"Developer tools","language":"PHP","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-23T21:50:56Z","updated":"2026-10-03T14:12:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The OpenAPI Command Bundle is a Symfony bundle that allows you to build HTTP APIs around Command Bus messages (DTOs) without the need for manual controller creation or Symfony #[Route] attributes on your commands.","By using standard OpenAPI operation attributes (from zircote/swagger-php) directly on your command DTOs, this bundle automatically generates Symfony routes and handles the entire request-to-command lifecycle: deserialization, validation, dispatching to the messenger bus, and responding."],"features":["OpenAPI-Driven Routing: Define your API endpoints directly on your command DTOs using #[OA\\Post], #[OA\\Get], #[OA\\Put], etc.","No Manual Controllers: A single CommandController handles all generated routes by default.","Automatic Deserialization: Automatically maps JSON request bodies, route parameters, and query parameters to your command DTOs.","Two-Layer Validation: Each request is checked against the OpenAPI schema (headers, query parameters, body shape via league/openapi-psr7-validator) and the deserialized command is validated with Symfony Validator…","Messenger Integration: Dispatches your commands directly to the Symfony Messenger bus."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stixx/openapi-command-bundle/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b5f1ae4b9b05549556a01bf356a920cbbe5129782f64ed4c193b225081c99e67","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The OpenAPI Command Bundle is a Symfony bundle that allows you to build HTTP APIs around Command Bus messages (DTOs) without the need for manual controller creation or Symfony #[Route] attributes on your commands.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stixx/openapi-command-bundle/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b5f1ae4b9b05549556a01bf356a920cbbe5129782f64ed4c193b225081c99e67","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stixx/openapi-command-bundle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T14:12:06Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stixx/openapi-command-bundle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","hash":"b5f1ae4b9b05549556a01bf356a920cbbe5129782f64ed4c193b225081c99e67","originalBytes":10642,"storedBytes":10642,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["command","openapi","stixx","bundle","api","symfony","openapicommandbundle","public","config","name","code","docs","messenger","model","php","route","under","validation","configuration","default","dtos","nelmioapidocbundle","project","routes","schema","true","annotations","any","assert","automatically","class","create","createprojectcommand","deprecation","details","directly","extension","handler","internal","json","license","nelmio","one","post","problem","return","routing","using","without","add","app","attribute","attributes","before","bundles.php","change","changelog","component","composer","customize","description","dir","directory","documentation","implement","kernel.project","key","minor","new","packages","parameters","part","patterns","reference","registered","release","replace","request","rfc","src","upgrading","validator",